{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1517146-changeling-contracts","id":1517146,"title":"Changeling Contracts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-04T01:52:38-07:00","id":1517146,"title":"Changeling Contracts","content":"I apologize if this was already answered in a previous thread but I was wondering about something. I noticed in the Changeling: The Lost 2nd Edition Common Regalia/Court Contracts cost 3 Experience and Royal Regalia/Court Contracts cost 4 Experience, however the experience costs for each is one less if the Contract is from a favored Regalia. My question is this, can a Changeling purchase a Contract from a Regalia that is not one of the two favored Regalia chosen at character creation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-04T02:06:50-07:00","id":1517147,"title":"","content":"I... think so?<br /> <br /> Edit: sorry, do you mean &quot;can a Character in Character Creation purchase Regalia Contracts outside of their Favored ones&quot;? Or &quot;can a Changeling purchase -at any time during play- contracts from outside their Favored Regalia&quot;? I believe the answer is &quot;yes&quot; for both, but I'm not sure if I was parsing right","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My